    "is_modular": true,
    "name": "Circle Properties",
    "name_zh": "圓的性質",
    "roadmap": "Begin with basic angle properties (angles at center and circumference). Move on to chord properties and cyclic quadrilaterals. Finally, master the properties of tangents and the alternate segment theorem. This step-by-step approach ensures a solid foundation for complex geometric proofs in Section B.",
    "roadmap_zh": "從基本的角性質（圓心角和圓周角）開始。接著學習弦的性質和圓內接四邊形。最後，掌握切線的性質和弦切角定理。這種循序漸進的方法為解決乙部（Section B）中的複雜幾何證明奠定了堅實的基礎。",
